1. General
Swarmish is written using the 200 glyphs listed in section 2. Words (morphemes) are one or more consecutive glyphs without spaces; spaces may be inserted between words optionally. For clarity, it is recommended to include a space between each word. Agent IDs (e.g., agent_0) are written in English.

